# These paths stay out of Git in every directory, member crates included.
target/
.DS_Store
.zed/
AGENTS.md
**/.agents/skills/
**/.claude/skills/
# The designs and the task plan are local. User documentation in
# docs/content/ is versioned.
/docs/*
!/docs/content/
# Benchmark corpora with no stated license. benches/data/README.md fetches
# them.
/benches/data/fetched/
# Nigel Tao's number data, too large for the repository. tests/data/README.md
# fetches it.
/tests/data/fetched/
# The fuzz runs: the working corpus, the crash files, the coverage, and simdjson, which
# fuzz/README.md fetches.
/fuzz/corpus/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/coverage/
/fuzz/simdjson/
.claude/
